      Entry: 7
      Data: 58|System.Collections.Generic.Dictionary`2[[Dark.Tools.Language.LanguageType,
        Assembly-CSharp],[System.String, mscorlib]], mscorlib
    - Name: comparer
      Entry: 9
      Data: 4
    - Name: 
      Entry: 12
      Data: 5
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 0
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "While warriors clash in the brutal chaos of the frontlines, elite archers
        stand behind them\u2014imbuing their bows with arcane power. With the legendary
        Sightsunder in hand, they fire arrows that tear through the wind, striking
        true into the hearts of their enemies."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 1
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Khi c\xE1c chi\u1EBFn binh lao v\xE0o nhau gi\u1EEFa s\u1EF1 h\u1ED7n
        lo\u1EA1n t\xE0n kh\u1ED1c n\u01A1i ti\u1EC1n tuy\u1EBFn, nh\u1EEFng cung
        th\u1EE7 tinh nhu\u1EC7 \u0111\u1EE9ng ph\xEDa sau\u2014truy\u1EC1n s\u1EE9c
        m\u1EA1nh huy\u1EC1n b\xED v\xE0o nh\u1EEFng c\xE2y cung c\u1EE7a m\xECnh.
        V\u1EDBi Sightsunder huy\u1EC1n tho\u1EA1i trong tay, h\u1ECD b\u1EAFn ra
        nh\u1EEFng m\u0169i t\xEAn x\xE9 gi\xF3, ghim th\u1EB3ng v\xE0o tim k\u1EBB
        th\xF9."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 2
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Mientras los guerreros chocan en el brutal caos de la vanguardia, arqueros
        de \xE9lite se alzan detr\xE1s de ellos, imbuyendo sus arcos con poder arcano.
        Con el legendario Sightsunder en mano, disparan flechas que rasgan el viento,
        acertando con certeza en los corazones enemigos."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 3
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Enquanto guerreiros se chocam no caos brutal das linhas de frente, arqueiros
        de elite se posicionam atr\xE1s deles, imbuindo seus arcos com poder arcano.
        Com o lend\xE1rio Sightsunder em m\xE3os, disparam flechas que rasgam o vento,
        acertando em cheio o cora\xE7\xE3o de seus inimigos."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 4
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "W\xE4hrend Krieger im brutalen Chaos der Frontlinien aufeinanderprallen,
        stehen Elitesch\xFCtzen hinter ihnen und durchdringen ihre B\xF6gen mit arkaner
        Macht. Mit dem legend\xE4ren Sightsunder in der Hand feuern sie Pfeile, die
        durch den Wind schneiden und unfehlbar die Herzen ihrer Feinde durchbohren."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 13
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 1
      Data: key_des_class_knight_full
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 7
