      Entry: 3
      Data: 0
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "This weapon was once entrusted to the elite warriors of the Blue Sentinel
        legion. Sharper than anything known, it was wielded by those capable of channeling
        arcane power into its edge\u2014delivering devastating strikes that drove
        back the Redgaze."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 1
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "V\u0169 kh\xED n\xE0y t\u1EEBng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c trao cho nh\u1EEFng
        chi\u1EBFn binh tinh nhu\u1EC7 c\u1EE7a qu\xE2n \u0111o\xE0n Blue Sentinel.
        S\u1EAFc b\xE9n h\u01A1n b\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 th\u1EE9 g\xEC t\u1EEBng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
        bi\u1EBFt \u0111\u1EBFn, n\xF3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng b\u1EDFi
        nh\u1EEFng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\xF3 kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng truy\u1EC1n s\u1EE9c
        m\u1EA1nh huy\u1EC1n b\xED v\xE0o l\u01B0\u1EE1i ki\u1EBFm\u2014tung ra nh\u1EEFng
        \u0111\xF2n \u0111\xE1nh h\u1EE7y di\u1EC7t \u0111\u1EA9y l\xF9i Redgaze."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 2
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Esta arma fue anta\xF1o confiada a los guerreros de \xE9lite de la legi\xF3n
        Blue Sentinel. M\xE1s afilada que cualquier otra, era empu\xF1ada por aquellos
        capaces de canalizar poder arcano en su filo, asestando golpes devastadores
        que hicieron retroceder a los Redgaze."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 3
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Esta arma foi outrora confiada aos guerreiros de elite da legi\xE3o
        Sentinela Azul. Mais afiada do que qualquer outra j\xE1 conhecida, era empunhada
        por aqueles capazes de canalizar poder arcano em seu fio, desferindo golpes
        devastadores que fizeram os Redgaze recuarem."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 4
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Diese Waffe wurde einst den Elitekriegern der Blauen W\xE4chterlegion
        anvertraut. Sch\xE4rfer als alles Bekannte, wurde sie von jenen gef\xFChrt,
        die arkane Macht in ihre Klinge zu lenken vermochten, und verheerende Hiebe
        entfesselten, die die Redgaze zur\xFCckschlugen."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
