      Entry: 1
      Data: Ashes are consumed to reset a learned skill and reclaim its branch's
        invested resources. Remained when power is burned away, ashes carry the memory
        of what once was, allowing a path to be walked again.
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 1
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Ashed \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c d\xF9ng \u0111\u1EC3 reset m\u1ED9t k\u1EF9
        n\u0103ng \u0111\xE3 h\u1ECDc v\xE0 thu h\u1ED3i c\xE1c t\xE0i nguy\xEAn
        \u0111\xE3 d\xF9ng v\xE0o nh\xE1nh c\u1EE7a n\xF3. \u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA1o
        ra khi s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh b\u1ECB thi\xEAu r\u1EE5i, ashes mang theo k\xFD
        \u1EE9c c\u1EE7a nh\u1EEFng g\xEC \u0111\xE3 t\u1EEBng t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i,
        cho ph\xE9p l\u1EF1a ch\u1ECDn con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n
        n\u1EEFa."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 2
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: Ashes se consumen para reiniciar una habilidad aprendida y recuperar
        los recursos invertidos en su rama. Nacidas cuando el poder es reducido a
        cenizas, Ashes conservan la memoria de lo que una vez fue, permitiendo recorrer
        el camino nuevamente.
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 3
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Ashes s\xE3o consumidas para redefinir uma habilidade aprendida e recuperar
        os recursos investidos em seu ramo. Formadas quando o poder \xE9 reduzido
        a cinzas, Ashes carregam a mem\xF3ria do que j\xE1 foi, permitindo que o
        caminho seja trilhado novamente."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 4
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Ashes werden verbraucht, um eine erlernte F\xE4higkeit zur\xFCckzusetzen
        und die in ihren Zweig investierten Ressourcen zur\xFCckzuerhalten. Entstanden,
        wenn Macht zu Asche verbrannt wird, tr\xE4gt Ashes die Erinnerung an das,
        was einst war, und erm\xF6glicht es, den Pfad erneut zu beschreiten."
    - Name: 
