    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "While warriors clash in the brutal chaos of the frontlines, elite archers
        stand behind them\u2014imbuing their bows with arcane power. With the legendary
        Sightsunder in hand, they fire arrows that tear through the wind, striking
        true into the hearts of their enemies"
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 1
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Khi c\xE1c chi\u1EBFn binh giao tranh trong s\u1EF1 h\u1ED7n lo\u1EA1n
        t\xE0n kh\u1ED1c n\u01A1i ti\u1EC1n tuy\u1EBFn, nh\u1EEFng cung th\u1EE7
        tinh nhu\u1EC7 \u0111\u1EE9ng ph\xEDa sau\u2014truy\u1EC1n s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh
        ma thu\u1EADt v\xE0o c\xE2y cung c\u1EE7a m\xECnh. V\u1EDBi Sightsunder huy\u1EC1n
        tho\u1EA1i trong tay, h\u1ECD b\u1EAFn ra nh\u1EEFng m\u0169i t\xEAn x\xE9
        gi\xF3, ghim th\u1EB3ng v\xE0o tim k\u1EBB th\xF9."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 2
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Mientras los guerreros chocan en el brutal caos del frente, los arqueros
        de \xE9lite se mantienen detr\xE1s, imbuyendo sus arcos con poder arcano.
        Con el legendario Sightsunder en mano, disparan flechas que rasgan el viento
        y se clavan con precisi\xF3n en el coraz\xF3n de sus enemigos."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 3
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Enquanto os guerreiros colidem no caos brutal da linha de frente, arqueiros
        de elite permanecem atr\xE1s, imbuindo seus arcos com poder arcano. Com o
        lend\xE1rio Sightsunder em m\xE3os, disparam flechas que rasgam o vento e
        atingem em cheio o cora\xE7\xE3o de seus inimigos."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 4
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "W\xE4hrend die Krieger im brutalen Chaos der Front aufeinandertreffen,
        stehen Elite-Bogensch\xFCtzen hinter ihnen und erf\xFCllen ihre B\xF6gen
        mit arkaner Macht. Mit dem legend\xE4ren Sightsunder in der Hand verschie\xDFen
        sie Pfeile, die den Wind durchschneiden und treffsicher die Herzen ihrer
        Feinde durchbohren."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
