    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "The Verge is the ruined frontier between humanity and The Nullnest,
        where ancient Towers seal the Gates to the mortal world. In the abyss beyond,
        the relentless Redgaze wait \u2014 for only by destroying a Tower can they
        break through. Barren and lifeless, The Verge is nothing but an endless battlefield
        of ash and war."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 1
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "The Verge l\xE0 v\xF9ng bi\xEAn t\xE0n l\u1EE5i gi\u1EEFa nh\xE2n lo\u1EA1i
        v\xE0 The Nullnest, n\u01A1i nh\u1EEFng T\xF2a Th\xE1p c\u1ED5 x\u01B0a phong
        \u1EA5n c\xE1c C\xE1nh C\u1ED5ng d\u1EABn v\xE0o th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi lo\xE0i
        ng\u01B0\u1EDDi. Trong v\u1EF1c th\u1EB3m ph\xEDa b\xEAn kia, l\u0169 Redgaze
        kh\xF4ng ng\u1EEBng ch\u1EDD \u0111\u1EE3i \u2014 b\u1EDFi ch\u1EC9 khi ph\xE1
        h\u1EE7y \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c m\u1ED9t T\xF2a Th\xE1p, ch\xFAng m\u1EDBi c\xF3
        th\u1EC3 tr\xE0n qua. C\u1EB1n c\u1ED7i v\xE0 kh\xF4ng c\xF2n s\u1EF1 s\u1ED1ng,
        The Verge ch\u1EC9 c\xF2n l\xE0 chi\u1EBFn tr\u01B0\u1EDDng v\xF4 t\u1EADn
        c\u1EE7a tro t\xE0n v\xE0 chi\u1EBFn tranh."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 2
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "The Verge es la frontera en ruinas entre la humanidad y The Nullnest,
        donde antiguas Torres sellan las Puertas al mundo mortal. En el abismo m\xE1s
        all\xE1, los implacables Redgaze esperan \u2014 pues solo destruyendo una
        Torre podr\xE1n irrumpir. \xC1rido y sin vida, The Verge no es m\xE1s que
        un interminable campo de batalla de ceniza y guerra."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 3
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "The Verge \xE9 a fronteira em ru\xEDnas entre a humanidade e The Nullnest,
        onde Torres ancestrais selam os Port\xF5es para o mundo mortal. No abismo
        al\xE9m, os implac\xE1veis Redgaze aguardam \u2014 pois somente ao destruir
        uma Torre poder\xE3o atravessar. \xC1rido e sem vida, The Verge n\xE3o passa
        de um campo de batalha infinito de cinzas e guerra."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 4
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "The Verge ist die verw\xFCstete Grenzlinie zwischen der Menschheit und
        The Nullnest, wo uralte T\xFCrme die Tore zur sterblichen Welt versiegeln.
        Im Abgrund dahinter warten die unerm\xFCdlichen Redgaze \u2014 denn nur durch
        die Zerst\xF6rung eines Turms k\xF6nnen sie hindurchbrechen. Karg und leblos
        ist The Verge nichts weiter als ein endloses Schlachtfeld aus Asche und Krieg."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
