    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "The Redgaze were once human, who forged The Nullnest through forbidden
        magic to escape a dying world. Twisted by the ritual \u2014 eyes crimson,
        flesh darkened \u2014 they were cast out and sealed away. In exile, their
        hatred grew, and so began the war that would rage until a hero created The
        Verge to end it."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 1
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Redgaze t\u1EEBng l\xE0 con ng\u01B0\u1EDDi, nh\u1EEFng k\u1EBB \u0111\xE3
        t\u1EA1o ra The Nullnest b\u1EB1ng ma thu\u1EADt c\u1EA5m k\u1EF5 \u0111\u1EC3
        tho\xE1t kh\u1ECFi m\u1ED9t th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi \u0111ang h\u1EA5p h\u1ED1i.
        B\u1ECB bi\u1EBFn d\u1EA1ng b\u1EDFi nghi l\u1EC5 \u2014 \u0111\xF4i m\u1EAFt
        \u0111\u1ECF th\u1EABm, th\xE2n x\xE1c nhu\u1ED1m b\xF3ng t\u1ED1i \u2014
        h\u1ECD b\u1ECB tr\u1EE5c xu\u1EA5t v\xE0 phong \u1EA5n. Trong l\u01B0u \u0111\xE0y,
        l\xF2ng h\u1EADn th\xF9 d\xE2ng cao, v\xE0 cu\u1ED9c chi\u1EBFn b\xF9ng n\u1ED5,
        k\xE9o d\xE0i cho \u0111\u1EBFn khi m\u1ED9t anh h\xF9ng t\u1EA1o n\xEAn
        The Verge \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1EA5m d\u1EE9t t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 2
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Los Redgaze fueron una vez humanos, quienes forjaron The Nullnest mediante
        magia prohibida para escapar de un mundo moribundo. Retorcidos por el ritual
        \u2014 ojos carmes\xED, carne oscurecida \u2014 fueron desterrados y sellados.
        En el exilio, su odio creci\xF3, y as\xED comenz\xF3 la guerra que arder\xEDa
        hasta que un h\xE9roe cre\xF3 The Verge para ponerle fin."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 3
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Os Redgaze foram outrora humanos, que forjaram The Nullnest por meio
        de magia proibida para escapar de um mundo moribundo. Deformados pelo ritual
        \u2014 olhos carmesim, carne enegrecida \u2014 foram expulsos e selados.
        No ex\xEDlio, seu \xF3dio cresceu, e assim teve in\xEDcio a guerra que rugiria
        at\xE9 que um her\xF3i criasse The Verge para encerr\xE1-la."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 4
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Die Redgaze waren einst Menschen, die The Nullnest mit verbotener Magie
        erschufen, um einer sterbenden Welt zu entkommen. Durch das Ritual entstellt
        \u2014 scharlachrote Augen, verdunkeltes Fleisch \u2014 wurden sie versto\xDFen
        und versiegelt. Im Exil wuchs ihr Hass, und so begann der Krieg, der w\xFCten
        sollte, bis ein Held The Verge erschuf, um ihn zu beenden."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
