    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "They were once fractures in reality \u2014 wounds through which the
        Redgaze could enter the mortal world. None remember who raised the three
        great Towers to seal those rifts. Yet the Towers bind more than the abyss
        \u2014 they also imprison their chosen guardian, chaining him to an unyielding
        fate: to defend them for eternity."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 1
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Ch\xFAng t\u1EEBng l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng v\u1EBFt n\u1EE9t c\u1EE7a th\u1EF1c
        t\u1EA1i \u2014 l\u1ED1i v\xE0o \u0111\u1EC3 Redgaze tr\xE0n v\xE0o th\u1EBF
        gi\u1EDBi lo\xE0i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi. Kh\xF4ng ai c\xF2n nh\u1EDB ai \u0111\xE3
        d\u1EF1ng n\xEAn ba T\xF2a Th\xE1p \u0111\u1EC3 phong \u1EA5n ch\xFAng. Nh\u01B0ng
        c\xE1c T\xF2a Th\xE1p kh\xF4ng ch\u1EC9 kh\xF3a ch\u1EB7t v\u1EF1c th\u1EB3m
        \u2014 ch\xFAng c\xF2n giam c\u1EA7m ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\u1ED9 v\u1EC7 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
        ch\u1ECDn, tr\xF3i bu\u1ED9c anh v\xE0o s\u1ED1 m\u1EC7nh v\u0129nh vi\u1EC5n
        b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 ch\xFAng."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 2
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Fueron fracturas en la realidad \u2014 puertas por las que los Redgaze
        entraban al mundo mortal. Nadie recuerda qui\xE9n alz\xF3 las tres Torres
        para sellarlas. Pero las Torres no solo contienen el abismo \u2014 tambi\xE9n
        aprisionan a su guardi\xE1n elegido, at\xE1ndolo a un destino eterno de defensa."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 3
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Foram fraturas na realidade \u2014 passagens pelas quais os Redgaze
        invadiam o mundo mortal. Ningu\xE9m se recorda de quem ergueu as tr\xEAs
        Torres para sel\xE1-las. Mas as Torres n\xE3o aprisionam apenas o abismo
        \u2014 tamb\xE9m mant\xEAm seu guardi\xE3o escolhido preso a um destino eterno
        de defend\xEA-las."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 4
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Einst waren sie Risse in der Wirklichkeit \u2014 Tore, durch die die
        Redgaze in die sterbliche Welt eindrangen. Niemand wei\xDF mehr, wer die
        drei T\xFCrme errichtete, um sie zu versiegeln. Doch die T\xFCrme binden
        nicht nur den Abgrund \u2014 sie fesseln auch ihren erw\xE4hlten H\xFCter
        an das ewige Schicksal, sie zu verteidigen."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
