      Entry: 3
      Data: 0
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Echoes are the lingering memories, experiences, skills, and instincts
        of all beings \u2014 torn from their souls when magic drains them completely.
        They are fragments of what once was, drifting remnants of thought and will,
        severed from the life that once gave them form."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 1
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Echoes l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng k\xFD \u1EE9c, tr\u1EA3i nghi\u1EC7m, k\u1EF9
        n\u0103ng v\xE0 b\u1EA3n n\u0103ng c\xF2n v\u01B0\u01A1ng l\u1EA1i c\u1EE7a
        m\u1ECDi sinh v\u1EADt \u2014 b\u1ECB x\xE9 kh\u1ECFi linh h\u1ED3n khi ma
        thu\u1EADt r\xFAt c\u1EA1n ch\xFAng ho\xE0n to\xE0n. Ch\xFAng l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng
        m\u1EA3nh v\u1EE1 c\u1EE7a qu\xE1 kh\u1EE9, t\xE0n d\u01B0 c\u1EE7a \xFD
        ch\xED v\xE0 nh\u1EADn th\u1EE9c, t\xE1ch r\u1EDDi kh\u1ECFi s\u1EF1 s\u1ED1ng
        t\u1EEBng trao cho ch\xFAng h\xECnh h\xE0i."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 2
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Los Echoes son los recuerdos, experiencias, habilidades e instintos
        persistentes de todos los seres \u2014 arrancados de sus almas cuando la
        magia los drena por completo. Son fragmentos de lo que fueron, restos errantes
        de pensamiento y voluntad, separados de la vida que una vez les dio forma."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 3
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Os Echoes s\xE3o as mem\xF3rias, experi\xEAncias, habilidades e instintos
        remanescentes de todos os seres \u2014 arrancados de suas almas quando a
        magia os drena completamente. S\xE3o fragmentos do que um dia foram, vest\xEDgios
        errantes de pensamento e vontade, separados da vida que antes lhes dava forma."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 4
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Echoes sind die verbleibenden Erinnerungen, Erfahrungen, F\xE4higkeiten
        und Instinkte aller Wesen \u2014 aus ihren Seelen gerissen, wenn Magie sie
        vollst\xE4ndig aussaugt. Sie sind Fragmente dessen, was einst war, umherirrende
        Reste von Gedanken und Willen, getrennt vom Leben, das ihnen einst Gestalt
        verlieh."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
