    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Sigils are formed by the primordial Redgaze \u2014 the first to wield
        forbidden soul-stealing magic. Deemed too dangerous for the mortal world,
        they were cast into Nullnest. Yet their power endures, bound within the symbols
        they left behind."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
      Data: 
    - Name: 
      Entry: 7
      Data: 
    - Name: $k
      Entry: 3
      Data: 1
    - Name: $v
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Sigils \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EA1o n\xEAn b\u1EDFi nh\u1EEFng Redgaze
        nguy\xEAn th\u1EE7y \u2014 nh\u1EEFng k\u1EBB \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn s\u1EED
        d\u1EE5ng ma thu\u1EADt c\u1EA5m. B\u1ECB xem l\xE0 qu\xE1 nguy hi\u1EC3m
        v\u1EDBi th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi ph\xE0m tr\u1EA7n, h\u1ECD b\u1ECB \u0111\xE0y
        v\xE0o Nullnest. Th\u1EBF nh\u01B0ng s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD
        v\u1EABn c\xF2n t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i trong nh\u1EEFng \u1EA5n k\xFD \u0111\u1EC3
        l\u1EA1i."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
